    {
      "id": "LqUHwmohxg6WWJ6zyHHLc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 307,
      "y": 492.5,
      "width": 1198,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1988639792,
      "version": 142,
      "versionNonce": 1656675376,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790905191368,
      "created": 1790905150192,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Its is an online distributed platform for collecting and monitoring logs in one place.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Its is an online distributed platform for collecting and monitoring logs in one place.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lEvlE9UEaXsWya5wmKfxs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 285,
      "y": 608.5,
      "width": 780.8195190429688,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1914127408,
      "version": 383,
      "versionNonce": 1318870576,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790905536217,
      "created": 1790905228772,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Functional Requirements\n- System should ingest logs from multiple sources.\n- System should support both real-time streaming and batch log ingestion\n- System should validate, parse, and normalized logs into a standard structure\n- User should be able to see the logs in the dashboard in almost near real-time ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Functional Requirements\n- System should ingest logs from multiple sources.\n- System should support both real-time streaming and batch log ingestion\n- System should validate, parse, and normalized logs into a standard structure\n- User should be able to see the logs in the dashboard in almost near real-time ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sLy35QGaBT1eBtu_DSuVY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1151.8100891113281,
      "y": 615.5,
      "width": 580.1595458984375,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2110042672,
      "version": 391,
      "versionNonce": 1304874032,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790905720105,
      "created": 1790905245089,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Non- Functional Requirements\n- Scale : millions of events per hours\n- Latency: low latency processing (near-real time)\n- CAP: Availability >> Consistency (System should be always\n    available for ingestion)\n- Reliable: No data loss",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Non- Functional Requirements\n- Scale : millions of events per hours\n- Latency: low latency processing (near-real time)\n- CAP: Availability >> Consistency (System should be always\n    available for ingestion)\n- Reliable: No data loss",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
